(7670395, 1251951, 173844, '<td valign="top">A simple/complex composition that sings.  Lovely placement of the main elements on a fascinating, wild grid-like background.  I wonder if that background was translated into black and white.  And of course the boat, symbol of freedom for so many, so ultimately off the grid.<br/>One of three personal co-favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'A simple/complex composition that sings.  Lovely placement of the main elements on a fascinating, wild grid-like background.  I wonder if that background was translated into black and white.  And of course the boat, symbol of freedom for so many, so ultimately off the grid.One of three personal co-favorites of the challenge.', '2020-07-21 11:50:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670398, 1251852, 173844, '<td valign="top">A Fourth of July celebration, American paean to independence, though the freedom aspect is rather nicked.  But this is lovely, a quiet -  except for the fireworks  - gathering in the neighborhood, friends and familiars joining in a summer ritual.  It looks so very right.  The beautifully balanced composition echoes the intimacy and mood.  Happily lit by the fireworks.  And details such as the moon peeking through the tree, the hyphenated wire overhead, it all conjures up a delicious moment, birth of a golden memory.  Perfect in black and white.<br/>One of three personal co-favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'A Fourth of July celebration, American paean to independence, though the freedom aspect is rather nicked.  But this is lovely, a quiet -  except for the fireworks  - gathering in the neighborhood, friends and familiars joining in a summer ritual.  It looks so very right.  The beautifully balanced composition echoes the intimacy and mood.  Happily lit by the fireworks.  And details such as the moon peeking through the tree, the hyphenated wire overhead, it all conjures up a delicious moment, birth of a golden memory.  Perfect in black and white.One of three personal co-favorites of the challenge.', '2020-07-21 12:11:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670399, 1251840, 173844, '<td valign="top">Luminous, spectacular image.  Seemingly lop-sided but, it appears to me, handsomely, daringly balanced left and right.  The bright city casts its glowing shadow on the water, sending emissary colors into the night.  The parabolic arc of the water is a fascinating compositional element, about which the scene unfolds.  The person in the water, in a pose that clicks, is the emotional lighthouse.  Perhaps he''s empowering the city, unbeknownst to a sleeping citizenry.  The out of focus waves are an ingenious framing device.  More than satisfying.<br/>One of three personal co-favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'Luminous, spectacular image.  Seemingly lop-sided but, it appears to me, handsomely, daringly balanced left and right.  The bright city casts its glowing shadow on the water, sending emissary colors into the night.  The parabolic arc of the water is a fascinating compositional element, about which the scene unfolds.  The person in the water, in a pose that clicks, is the emotional lighthouse.  Perhaps he''s empowering the city, unbeknownst to a sleeping citizenry.  The out of focus waves are an ingenious framing device.  More than satisfying.One of three personal co-favorites of the challenge.', '2020-07-21 12:35:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7670639, 1251952, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love, love love this!</td>', 'I love, love love this!', '2020-07-23 17:22:09.000000', NULL, 0),
